          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Midlertidig basal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The UUID from Luped Remote's package.json, for a build of your own. It must differ from the watchface's." : {
      "comment" : "Footer explaining the Luped Remote UUID",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "UUID-en fra package.json i Luped Remote, for en egen versjon. Den må være forskjellig fra urskivens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The UUID from the watchface's package.json. The watchface must use Luped's AppMessage keys and must not use PebbleKit JS." : {
      "comment" : "Footer explaining the Pebble watchface UUID",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "UUID-en fra urskivens package.json. Urskiven må bruke Lupeds AppMessage-nøkler og kan ikke bruke PebbleKit JS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reading from %1$@ is on your watch. New readings appear as soon as %2$@ receives them." : {
      "comment" : "Pebble setup detail: done (1: reading time, 2: app name)",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Målingen fra %1$@ vises på klokken. Nye målinger vises så snart %2$@ mottar dem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The status line shows under the glucose ring and dims when %1$@ hasn't looped for 16 minutes. Last Loop is always shown with a status line." : {
      "comment" : "Footer for the Pebble Graph layout with a status line chosen (1: app name)",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Statuslinjen vises under glukoseringen og dempes når %1$@ ikke har loopet på 16 minutter. Siste loop vises alltid sammen med en statuslinje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The watch also beeps for these alarms. Set its volume on the watch." : {
      "comment" : "Footer for the Pebble alarm sound, shown while a sound is chosen",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klokken piper også for disse alarmene. Still inn volumet på klokken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The watch buzzes each time %1$@ alerts, and stays silent while %1$@'s alerts are muted. %1$@'s own alerts don't change." : {
      "comment" : "Footer for the Pebble alarm settings (1: app name)",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klokken vibrerer hver gang %1$@ varsler, og er stille mens varslene til %1$@ er dempet. Varslene i %1$@ endres ikke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The watch found %@." : {
      "comment" : "Pebble setup detail: connecting (1: app name)",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klokken fant %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The watch is connected, but Luped CGM isn't the active watchface, so it can't show readings. Select it on the watch; %@ tries again by itself." : {
      "comment" : "Pebble setup detail: watchface not running (1: app name)",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klokken er tilkoblet, men Luped CGM er ikke den aktive urskiven, så den kan ikke vise målinger. Velg den på klokken; %@ prøver igjen av seg selv."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The watch may get an occasional extra update between readings." : {
      "comment" : "Pebble footer: battery note when loop status or therapy values are sent",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klokken kan av og til få en ekstra oppdatering mellom målingene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The watch reports this about once an hour, covering at most the last 48 hours. Refresh Watch Info asks now; the reply can take up to 30 seconds." : {
      "comment" : "Footer for the Pebble watch info section",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klokken rapporterer dette omtrent én gang i timen, for høyst de siste 48 timene. Oppdater klokkeinfo spør nå; svaret kan ta opptil 30 sekunder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is nothing to pair in %1$@: the watch finds %1$@ over the Pebble app's Bluetooth connection." : {
      "comment" : "Footer for the Pebble setup checklist (1: app name)",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det er ingenting å pare i %1$@: klokken finner %1$@ via Pebble-appens Bluetooth-tilkobling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of %1$@ can only update the watch while %1$@ is open." : {
      "comment" : "Pebble setup warning when the app lacks the bluetooth-peripheral background mode (1: app name)",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne versjonen av %1$@ kan bare oppdatere klokken mens %1$@ er åpen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the watchface's UUID, so Luped Remote gets no connection of its own. Use a different one." : {
      "comment" : "Footer when the Luped Remote UUID equals the watchface UUID",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dette er urskivens UUID, så Luped Remote får ingen egen tilkobling. Bruk en annen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
